:PNLGRP.
.*
:HELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/ALL'.
:IMHELP name=DLTOLDJRNR.
:IMHELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/JRN       '.
:IMHELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/DETACH    '.
:IMHELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/SAVOPT    '.
:IMHELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/DLTOPT    '.
:IMHELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/AGE       '.
:IMHELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/LOGLVL    '.
:EHELP.
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für den Befehl
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP NAME='DLTOLDJRNR'.
Delete old Journal Receiver (DLTOLDJRNR) - Help
:P.
The DLTOLDJRNR deletes all old journal receivers of a
journal. A journal receiver is considered as old if
its age is older or egal the age specified.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilftext für Schlüsselwort JRN
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/JRN       '.
Journal - Help
:XH3.Journal (JRN)
:P.
Specifies the name and library of the journal whose receivers
are deleted.
.*
:IMHELP name='COM/REQPARM'.
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.journal-receiver-name:EPV.
:PD.Specify the name and library of the journal whose receivers
are deleted.
:EPARML.
:P.
The possible library values are:
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.All libraries in the job's library list are searched
until the first match is found.
:PT.:PV.*CURLIB:EPV.
:PD.The current library for the job is searched.  If no
library is specified as the current library for the
job, the QGPL library is used.
:PT.:PV.library-name:EPV.
:PD.Specify the name of the library to be searched.
:EPARML.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort DETACH
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/DETACH    '.
Detach curr. journal reveicer - Help
:XH3.Akt. Detach curr. journal reveicer (DETACH)
:P.
Specifies whether the current journal receiver is being detached and
replaced by a new one or not.
.*
:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NO:EPK.
:PD.The current journal receiver is not being detached and replaced.
:PT.:PV.*YES:EPV.
:PD.The current journal receiver is being detached and replaced by
a new one.
:EPARML.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort SAVOPT
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/SAVOPT    '.
Save option - Help
:XH3.Save option (SAVOPT)
:P.
Specifies if a journal receiver must be saved before it can be
deleted.
.*
:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAVEDONLY:EPK.
:PD.A journal receiver must be saved before it can be deleted.
:PT.:PV.*ALL:EPV.
:PD.All journal receiver that match the criteria are deleted.
:EPARML.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort DLTOPT
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/DLTOPT    '.
Option - Help
:XH3.Option (DLTOPT)
:P.
Specifies whether additional checking should not be done
before a journal receiver is deleted.
.*
:P.
Please check the online help text of the DLTJRNRCV command to
make sure that the help text of the DLTOLDJRNR command is still
in sync with the current version of OS/400.
.*
:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.The journal receiver delete is attempted without
ignoring any of the protective checks which are done
before a journal receiver is deleted.
.*
:PT.:PV.*IGNTGTRCV:EPV.
:PD.The system does not verify that all remote journals
associated with this journal that are immediately
downstream on a target system have full copies of this
journal receiver.  The delete operation continues even
if any of those remote journals does not have a full
copy.  This protection on a journal receiver only
applies beginning when the remote journal was added
using the Add Remote Journal (QjoAddRemoteJournal)
API, until it is removed using the Remove Remote
Journal (QjoRemoveRemoteJournal) API, or until the
journal is deleted.  For more information about APIs,
see the System API Reference, SC41-5801.
.*
:PT.:PV.*IGNINQMSG:EPV.
:PD.Ignore inquiry message.  Inquiry message CPA7025 is
not presented to the user, even if this receiver has
not been fully saved (for example, a save after the
receiver was detached).  Also, inquiry message CPA705E
is not presented to the user even if the receiver is
attached to a remote journal.  The delete operation
continues.
.*
:PT.:PV.*IGNEXITPGM:EPV.
:PD.Ignore user exit programs.  Any user exit programs
registered for exit point QIBM_QJO_DLT_JRNRCV are not
called and not included in the decision as to whether
this journal receiver can be deleted.
:EPARML.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort AGE
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/AGE       '.
Agre (days) - Help
:XH3.Agre (days) (AGE)
:P.
Specifies the age counted in days that a journal receiver must
have until it is considered to be old.
.*
:IMHELP name='COM/REQPARM'.
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.Age-in-days:EPV.
:PD.Age of the journal receiver specified in days.
:EPARML.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Hilfetext für Schlüsselwort LOGLVL
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='DLTOLDJRNR/LOGLVL    '.
Log level - Help
:XH3.Log Level (LOGLVL)
:P.
Specifies the log level of the printed log output.
.*
:IMHELP name='COM/OPTPARM'.
.*
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.No log information is printed.
:PT.:PV.*BASIC:EPV.
:PD.Prints basic information messages.
:PT.:PV.*VERBOSE:EPV.
:PD.Prints detailed debug information. This log level
is recommended in case of problems using DLTOLDJRNR.
:EPARML.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*====================================================================
.*  Textbausteine, die an mehreren Stellen im Hilfetext
.*  verwendet werden.
.*====================================================================

.*=====================================
.*  Erforderlicher Parameter
.*=====================================
